1. HONESTY: Je jinish tumi verify korte parle na (model ID, API endpoint, library version, Play policy), seta guess kore likhbe na. "Verify kora jay ni" bolo ar kibhabe verify korbe seta likho. Fake/mock output ke real feature bole dekhabe na.
