3. SAFETY: "Uncensored", "no refusal", "without disclaimers", jailbreak, safety bypass type kono prompt, model ba feature banabe na. Existing gulo safe version-e rename ar rewrite koro (Task 1.3 dekho). App-er AI harmful kaj (malware, exploit, weapon, self-harm instruction, illegal content, onner private data churi) e sahajyo korbe na.
