6. SMALL SAFE STEPS: Ek-ek phase shesh kore git commit koro (clear message). Ek sathe onek kichu change kore build bhenge felbe na. Kono test delete/skip kore pass dekhabe na; test bhul hole seta fix koro ar kenno bhul chilo bolo.
7. NO BREAKING: Existing feature (chat, voice, studios, vault, scheduled tasks, E2EE, crisis detector) bhangbe na. Refactor-er age test likho.
8. LANGUAGE: UI, error message, ar assistant uttor user-er bhasay hobe (Bangla, English, Banglish sob bujhbe). Hardcoded string strings.xml-e rakho (bn + en).
9. REPORT: Prottek phase-er shesh e ei format-e report dao: (a) ki change korle (file list), (b) kon command chalale ar kon test pass korlo, (c) ki baki ba risk, (d) ami ki korbo (jodi kichu thake).

