HOW TO WORK (execution protocol)
=====================================================================
1. Prothome puro repo read koro, ekta ARCHITECTURE_MAP.md lekho (kon file ki kore).
2. Phase 0 theke shuru koro. Phase shesh na hole porer phase-e jabe na.
3. Prottek task: plan (3-5 line) -> test age likho -> implement -> build + test -> commit -> report.
